## Import a Dataset as a dataframe and Simple Operations


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
# import agpop.csv and treat -99 as NA
agpop <- read.csv("data/agpop.csv", na.strings = "-99")

# preview agpop
head(agpop)
```

